OL,3,GNEWSACeltic cool: The centuries-old
OL,4,Asounds taking over the dancefloor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA packed club dancefloor singing along
OL,7,Fto an Irish, Welsh, Cornish or Scottish
OL,8,FGaelic anthem would have been a fairly
OL,9,Frare sight a decade ago.
OL,11,FWhen it comes to popular music, those
OL,12,Flanguages - bar the odd 90s dance hit
OL,13,Flike Chicane's Saltwater or the rise of
OL,14,Frap trio Kneecap - were mostly reserved
OL,15,Ffor the trad and folk sections.
OL,17,FBut now, a new wave of musicians are
OL,18,Ftaking those Celtic languages even
OL,19,Ffurther into clubs, festivals and
OL,20,Fstreaming playlists.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
