OL,3,GNEWSACeltic cool: The centuries-old
OL,4,Asounds taking over the dancefloor
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom reimagined house bangers as
OL,7,FGaeilge (in Irish) to Cymru-Italodisco,
OL,8,Ftunes are popping up from TikTok under
OL,9,Fhashtags and genre labels such as
OL,10,F"gaelectropop", as coined by County
OL,11,FFermanagh's USNABOY.
